{"title":"Frost Giant","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 22 Hill Giant that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (7.7% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/giants-knucklebone\">Giants Knucklebone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/frost-giant\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/frost-giant?lv=22\">Lv 22</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/frost-giant?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>6</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/frost-giant?lv=24\">Lv 24 <span>7</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/frost-giant?lv=22\" title=\"Pick level 22\"><td><b>22</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>74</td><td>16.6</td><td>1,100</td><td class=\"muted\">222 · 23.2 · 3,300</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/frost-giant\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>23</b></td><td>79</td><td>17.2</td><td>1,150</td><td class=\"muted\">237 · 24.1 · 3,450</td><td>6</td><td>in the wilds around -311, -928</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/frost-giant?lv=24\" title=\"Pick level 24\"><td><b>24</b></td><td>84</td><td>17.7</td><td>1,200</td><td class=\"muted\">252 · 24.8 · 3,600</td><td>7</td><td>in the wilds around -289, -955</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"frost-giant\" data-map-level=\"23\">Show level 23 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-886.0px,852.9px)\"><i style=\"left:983.1px;top:-803.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:972.1px;top:-785.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:859.4px;top:-849.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:802.7px;top:-895.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:991.4px;top:-790.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:972.1px;top:-787.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:882.8px;top:-806.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:805.8px;top:-898.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:997.0px;top:-798.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:966.6px;top:-836.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:1001.0px;top:-843.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:902.0px;top:-880.7px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around -299, -943 <span class=\"muted\">· 7 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around -218, -933 <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around -250, -978 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"frost-giant\">Show on map</button>\n  